   "_verdict": "REJECTED 2026-06-23. Routed deep Baseball Savant (2015+) into the proj_lgbm challenger as versioned features: hitters +xwOBA, xwOBA-gap, EV, barrel% (38->42); pitchers +xwOBA/xISO/EV/barrel-against (31->36, first Statcast on that side). Forward-chained dev bases 2017-2021 vs the xISO-only v1 baseline ('dev' here): NO OOS lift - n-weighted mean MAE 0.4488 vs 0.4481 (worse at 4/5 horizons, tied at h5); coverage, survived-coverage and tail-ratio neutral-to-worse at every horizon; star MAE/bias tied; pinball noise-level. The contact-quality signal is redundant with the Marcel-regressed rates (iso/k/bb/babip/hr) + champion stack already in the vector, so the extra columns only add overfitting surface. Not shipped; live model unchanged (v1). Code on branch proj-statcast-v2 (features reverted; kept the experiment-independent hygiene fixes: proj_ml _SCHEMA_TAG cache-key versioning + predict_path feature-width guard)."
